}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ai/chat
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "messages": [
      { "role": "user", "content": "Wilayah mana yang paling memburuk saat ini?" }
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  # POST /api/v1/ai/chat

  The Nexorus Copilot (⌘K) chat. **Streams** a plain-text response (not JSON):
  live LLM tokens when configured, otherwise a scripted answer streamed
  word-by-word. Grounded in the current dashboard data.

  **Source:** `apps/web/app/api/v1/ai/chat/route.ts`
  **Auth:** none at the route; grounded in dashboard context.
  **Response:** `Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8`, `Cache-Control: no-store` — a token stream, so Bruno shows it arriving progressively.

  ## Request body
  ```json
  { "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "..." } ] }
  ```
  Only the last message content is used as the question.
}
